      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "•Derelict cottage on approx. 26 acres (10.6 ha)\n•Opportunity to create superb residential holding (Subject to planning permission)\n•Excellent location close to attractions such as Killeen Golf Club, The K-Club and the Grand Canal while also being within easy reach of Sallins, Kill and Naas. \n•The lands are laid out in two divisions, all in grass with excellent road frontage onto L2010 and frontage onto rail line\n\nSallins 3.5km, N7 (Kill) 5km, Naas 5km\n\nGuide Price \nPrice on application \n\nType of Transaction\nFor Sale by Public Auction on Thursday 15th October at 3pm in Lawlors Hotel, Naas, Co. Kildare.\n\nLocation \n\nKilleenmore is a townland located close to the commuter towns of Sallins, Naas and Kill in Co. Kildare. All local amenities such as schools, supermarkets, churches and sports clubs are provided for in these local towns. Transport links in the area are excellent with access to Sallins train station on the Dublin Heuston line, access to the M7 motorway at Naas and access to the N7 at Kill with regular bus services to Dublin also widely available. Attraactions in the area include Killeen Golf Club, the Grand Canal, Naas Racecourse and The K-Club at nearby Straffan\n\nAdditional Information\n•Approx. 1 acre in separate division with frontage onto Grand Canal\n•Excellent road frontage onto L2010\n•Frontage onto rail line\n•Good free draining lands\n\nDirections:\nFrom Dublin, take the N7, exit at Junction 7 and follow the road marked for Straffan/ Maynooth. Proceed for approx. 2km and take a left marked for Killeen Golf Club. Continue for approx. 2.6km and the property will be on the right hand side marked by a For Sale sign.\n\nSolicitors\nMr. Brian Roe of Hughes & Liddy LLP Solicitors, 22 Lower Leeson Street, Dublin 2. T: 01 6766763\n\nViewing\nBy appointment only.\n\nContact Information\nPhilip Byrne\nT: 01 628 6128\nE: info@coonan.com\n \n\n"
      },
